                <span>Quel est le prix d'Ozempic en France ?</span>
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transform group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
